    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110259" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φᾱνότης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ητος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>brightness, clearness,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aristid.
				<u>Or.</u>
				43(1).24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
