				10.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Comm.Math.</u>
				34
			</span></i>: metaph. in pl. of words, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ φ. τῶν ὀνομάτων</span>”
